r we could propose Candidate B because of reliability and stress handling, which are core.\n\nLet's decide: I think Candidate C's strengths (anticipate danger, complex connections, spatial vision, leadership) are highly relevant for safety-critical long-distance flights. The concerns (show-off, not open) are less directly safety-critical than nasty remarks or hot temper. So I will recommend Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference facts: anticipate dangerous situations, sees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership qualities. Also note concerns: regarded as a show-off, not open to new ideas.\n\nMake a statement: I recommend Candidate C, because of strong situational awareness and leadership, despite attitude concerns.\n\nProvide vote in metadata.\n\nProceed."}
